{{- /* Replaces #quiz once the points goal (and the target percentage, if required) is met.

This is the payoff for a quiz that takes several minutes, and it used to be three static
party emoji and a sentence. The finale is built from pieces CSS can animate individually,
which is the only reason any of this needs markup rather than a stylesheet:

  * every party emoji is its OWN span, because a single text node cannot be staggered;
  * every digit of every number is its own span (the `figure` helper), so they fly in from
    different directions and assemble;
  * the confetti is a fixed list of glyph / drift / spin / delay tuples rendered as inline
    custom properties -- the drift is a percentage of the CARD, not of the viewport, so the
    party cannot spill past the window edge and scroll the page. Fixed rather than random on
    purpose: the server renders this screen, and a reload should show the same party. The
    offsets are spread by hand, because a formula (`i * 37 % 100`) looks combed rather than
    scattered.

Inert without the game-feel toggle: `juice.css` scopes every rule to `body.juice`, so with it
off this is the same "party and a sentence" as before, in more spans. `aria-hidden` on the
decoration -- a screen reader wants the numbers and the sentence, not sixteen confetti. */ -}}
<div class="finale">
  <div class="confetti" aria-hidden="true">
    {{- range .Confetti }}
    <span class="confetti-bit" style="--drift: {{ .Drift }}%; --spin: {{ .Spin }}deg; --i: {{ .Step }}">{{ .Glyph }}</span>
    {{- end }}
  </div>

  <h2 class="celebrate" aria-hidden="true">
    {{- range $i, $_ := iterate 3 }}
    <span class="pop" style="--i: {{ $i }}">&#127881;</span>
    {{- end }}
  </h2>

  <p class="celebrate-text">Quiz complete!</p>

  <div class="finale-figures">
    <span class="finale-stat">
      {{ figure .Points "big" "" }}
      <span class="finale-label">points of {{ .Goal }}</span>
    </span>
    <span class="finale-stat">
      {{ figure .Percentage "" "%" }}
      <span class="finale-label">{{ .Correct }} of {{ .Attempted }} right</span>
    </span>
    <span class="finale-stat">
      {{ figure .Elapsed "" "s" }}
      <span class="finale-label">start to finish</span>
    </span>
  </div>

  <p class="celebrate-text">Well done, now take a break&hellip;</p>
  <img src="{{ .Prefix }}/media/completed.jpeg" alt="cat sleeping next to computer mouse" width="600" />
</div>
